text:
Lakip sa mga dapat sundon amo ang:

-Completion sang 10-day isolation sang Blackwater player matapos ang swabbing;-Completion sang 14-day quarantine kag testing antes ang pagsulod sa bubble para sa mga una nga nagpositibo sa virus;

-Appointment sang independent marshall nga amo ang maga-check kun ginasunod ang health and safety protocols santo sa ginapanugyan sang Department of the Interior and Local Government kag-Nagakadapat nga may separado nga temporary quarantine facility sa Clark Freeport Zone

english:
Among those to follow are:

-Completion of 10-day isolation of Blackwater player after swabbing;-Completion of 14-day quarantine and testing before entering the bubble for those who first tested positive for the virus;

-Appointment of an independent marshall who will check whether health and safety protocols are being followed as recommended by the Department of the Interior and Local Government and-There should be a separate temporary quarantine facility in the Clark Freeport Zone
